---
import{env}from'cloudflare:workers';import{frameworkUser}from'../../../fullstack-shared/backend';import'../../../fullstack-shared/style.css';const user=await frameworkUser(Astro.request,env);Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control','no-store');const renderedAt=new Date().toISOString();
---
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>WorkerKit · Astro</title></head><body><header><strong>WorkerKit · Astro</strong><a href="/">方案选择</a></header><main><h1>Astro 全栈验证</h1><p class="muted">真正的服务端渲染、Astro API 路由、Better Auth 会话与 Cloudflare KV。</p><div class="grid"><section><h2>服务端渲染</h2><p>框架：Astro 7</p><p>服务端生成时间：<code data-ssr-time>{renderedAt}</code></p><p>当前身份：{user?.username||user?.name||'未登录'}</p><a href="/standard/?redirect=%2Fastro%2F">登录 Hono + Better Auth</a></section><section><h2>原生 API 与 KV</h2><form id="verify"><label for="label">验证名称</label><input id="label" name="label" maxlength="80" disabled/><nav><button type="button" id="read" disabled>读取 KV</button><button type="submit" disabled>保存 KV</button></nav></form><p role="status" id="status"></p></section></div><section><h2>开发业务</h2><p>这个示例验证全栈部署链路。用户、任务、密钥、审计和 API 中心可以复用统一业务后端。</p><nav><a class="button" href="/standard/">打开管理工作台</a><a href="/docs/frameworks.html">查看接入说明</a><a href="/astro/api/verification">查看原生 API</a></nav></section></main><script>const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#verify')!,input=document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#label')!,status=document.querySelector('#status')!;async function probe(save=false){try{const response=await fetch('/astro/api/verification',{method:save?'POST':'GET',...(save?{headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({label:input.value})}:{})});const value=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw Error(value.error);input.value=value.label;status.textContent=save?'已保存到 KV':'读取成功 · '+value.framework;}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message;}}form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();probe(true);});document.querySelector('#read')!.addEventListener('click',()=>probe());form.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement|HTMLButtonElement>('input,button').forEach(element=>element.disabled=false);</script></body></html>
